<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">SSC-Khatumo</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">2023–</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">SSC-Khatumo is a political and military administration formed in 2023 by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dhulbahante">Dhulbahante</a> leaders in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sool">Sool</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sanaag">Sanaag</a> and Cayn areas of northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/somalia">Somalia</a>, who reject <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-somaliland">Somaliland</a>'s authority and seek to remain part of Somalia. Its forces fought the Somaliland army around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/las-anod">Las Anod</a> and in August 2023 drove it from its positions near the town. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/somalis">Somali</a> federal government recognised it as an interim administration.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ssc-khatumo.jpg" alt="SSC-Khatumo" width="320" height="175" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Wowzers122 · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_North_Eastern_State_of_Somalia.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
